go 1.26.0

// This use set is the gopls tool module alone, so go commands run from this directory never resolve through the repository root go.work.
// Dependabot's "Dependency Graph" job runs `go mod graph` here without GOWORK=off.
// Under the root go.work that command would graph the published modules rather than this one, and would fail outright while they require their siblings at the zero pseudo-version, leaving this module's graph degraded.
use .
